t an hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No-fail design</strong> - Always progress toward your infernal masterpiece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric pixel art</strong> - 8-bit hellish aesthetic with limited color palette</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of infernal architecture and fulfill the Dark Lord's vision in this unique blend of strategic building and roguelike deckbuilder.</p>","developers":["Cuddle Code"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842300/ca645d4f0636eec15e529a5245d2af492ef90398/header.jpg?t=1751375374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161864,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161864/movie480.mp4?t=1751375371","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161864/movie_max.mp4?t=1751375371"},"name":"Hell Builder Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161864/60559e6e174cfb717138e7ed8635307d0ca0a9e0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751375371","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161864/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751375371","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161864/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751375371"}}],"name":"Hell Builder","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 o